<title>SPAIN: Cantabrico to pay final dividend 53.75 pta.</title>
<headline>Cantabrico to pay final dividend 53.75 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish utility Hidroelectrica del Cantabrico said on Wednesday it would pay a final dividend of 53.75 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>The firm also said in a statement it had approved a 58.8 billion peseta asset revaluation bringing the value of its fixed assets to 254 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Total dividend in 1996 rose to 200 pesetas versus 175 pesetas a year before.</p>
<p>--Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
